  "input": {
    "handle": "fishtripper-village-le-grand-tango-210",
    "title": "FishTripper Village Le Grand Tango",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">“Fish that were previously inaccessible are now attainable.” </p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Le Grand Tango has acquired the admiration of countless anglers due to its persistent success. It is a top-notch diving pencil bait specifically crafted to entice fish that can't easily be found.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Fast response time thanks to leading-edge materials. Ensured stability and lift due to superior buoyancy. Wide flat side delivers unmatched dirt stirring and remarkable brightness.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lenght 190 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 85</p></li></ul>",
